== Effects ==
* Tears fired from Isaac's right eye have +28% [[Damage]], +6.5 [[Range]], and -0.3 [[Shot Speed]].

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Brimstone}} / {{I|Technology 2}}: Has a 50% chance to gain the Damage boost from Stye each individual time they deal damage.
* {{I|Stapler}} / {{C|Cain}} + {{I|Chemical Peel}} / {{I|Blood Clot}}: Each fired tear will have the effects of either Stye or Chemical Peel/Blood Clot.
* {{I|Dr. Fetus}}: Each bomb fired has a 50% chance of gaining the damage boost, but not its Range/Shot Speed effects. Affected bombs and their explosions are tinted a pale blue.
** The 28% damage boost is applied to Isaac's base tear damage and does not affect any ''other'' aspect of Dr. Fetus's damage calculation.
* {{i|Stye}}: Multiple copies do not stack. Only the first Stye obtained grants stat changes.

