== Trivia ==
* This item is similar to {{i|Blood Clot}} and {{I|Chemical Peel}}, which instead affect tears fired from Isaac's left eye only.
* A [[wikipedia:stye|stye]] is a medical condition which involves a painful swollen lump on the eye, usually on the inside of the eyelid.

